---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="About — Vinicius's notebook" description="Software engineer working where infrastructure meets product reality.">
  <div class="w-[min(720px,calc(100%-44px))] mx-auto">
    <main>

      <header class="page-head">
        <p class="page-meta">about</p>
        <h1 class="page-title">Hi, I'm Vinicius.</h1>
        <p class="page-sub">Software engineer. Bachelor of Mathematics. Working where infrastructure meets product reality.</p>
      </header>

      <div class="bio">
        <p>
          I work across Kubernetes, cloud infrastructure, platform engineering, and systems architecture.
          Most of my day-to-day sits between product needs and low-level infrastructure behavior —
          debugging clusters, shaping platform interfaces, writing automation,
          and documenting the parts that shouldn't need to be rediscovered later.
        </p>

        <p>
          I write in Go and Python. Go for Kubernetes-native tooling, operators, and control plane work.
          Python for APIs, automation pipelines, and data workflows. I'm an emeritus contributor to
          conda-forge, where I worked on the auto-tick bot infrastructure and package maintenance
          automation.
        </p>

        <p>
          My background is in applied mathematics — I studied at the Federal University of Santa
          Catarina with a focus on optimization, nonlinear programming, and computational geometry.
          My thesis work applied distance geometry and spectral methods to protein structure
          determination. I retain an active interest in computational neuroscience and optimization.
        </p>

        <p>
          This site is a notebook for whatever has my attention — sometimes infrastructure work,
          often other things. Mostly written for myself; useful if you're chasing similar questions.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="page-rule" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 200 14" preserveAspectRatio="none">
          <path d="M 4 7 Q 30 2, 60 7 T 120 7 T 196 7"
                fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        </svg>
      </div>

      <dl class="meta-list">
        <div class="meta-row">
          <dt>focus</dt>
          <dd>Platform engineering, Kubernetes, GitOps, identity, ingress, TLS, infrastructure reliability.</dd>
        </div>
        <div class="meta-row">
          <dt>currently</dt>
          <dd>Building platform automation with Go at OpenTeams. Debugging bare-metal K3s clusters. Writing notes for problems worth solving only once.</dd>
        </div>
        <div class="meta-row">
          <dt>background</dt>
          <dd>Mathematics and computer science at UFSC. Optimization, distance geometry, protein refinement. GSoC 2020 with conda-forge.</dd>
        </div>
        <div class="meta-row">
          <dt>approach</dt>
          <dd>Debug → understand → document. Production friction should produce architecture insight, not just a fix.</dd>
        </div>
        <div class="meta-row">
          <dt>links</dt>
          <dd>
            <a href="https://github.com/viniciusdc" class="profile-link">github.com/viniciusdc</a>
            <span class="link-sep">·</span>
            <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/vinicius-douglas-530202142/" class="profile-link">linkedin</a>
            <span class="link-sep">·</span>
            <a href="https://twitter.com/Ceture_it" class="profile-link">@Ceture_it</a>
          </dd>
        </div>
      </dl>

    </main>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-head {
    padding: clamp(72px, 9vw, 120px) 0 clamp(28px, 4vw, 40px);
  }
  .page-meta {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--accent);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    margin: 0 0 22px;
  }
  .page-title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: clamp(32px, 4.2vw, 46px);
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: var(--foreground);
    margin: 0 0 18px;
  }
  .page-sub {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 60ch;
  }

  .bio {
    padding: clamp(24px, 4vw, 36px) 0 0;
  }
  .bio p {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 17px;
    color: var(--foreground);
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin: 0 0 22px;
    max-width: 64ch;
  }

  .page-rule {
    color: var(--faint);
    padding: clamp(28px, 4vw, 44px) 0 clamp(24px, 4vw, 40px);
    opacity: 0.5;
  }
  .page-rule svg {
    display: block;
    width: clamp(120px, 22vw, 200px);
    height: 14px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .meta-list {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0 0 clamp(64px, 8vw, 96px);
    display: grid;
    gap: 14px;
  }
  .meta-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 100px 1fr;
    gap: 20px;
    align-items: baseline;
  }
  .meta-row dt {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .meta-row dd {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .profile-link {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 13px;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }
  .profile-link:hover { text-decoration-thickness: 2px; }
  .link-sep { color: var(--faint); margin: 0 6px; }
  @media (max-width: 520px) {
    .meta-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 4px; }
  }
</style>
